WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.220
It is a beautiful morning. Jot is walking in the park.

2
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.040
What a nice day.

3
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.220
What's that?

4
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.780
Jot sees something in the sky. Can you see it?

5
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:32.520
Everyone, look up. Can you point to the balloon?

6
00:00:42.661 --> 00:00:46.860
A balloon. Hello, balloon. Come back.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.520
Oh, no, the balloon is flying away.

8
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.690
Jot follows the balloon. Let's go with Jot.

9
00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:06.510
March. March, march, march.

10
00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:15.120
Wait, balloon. Wait for me.

11
00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.250
The balloon blows away.

12
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.680
Point to the balloon.

13
00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.641
Where did this come from?

14
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:45.060
There you are. Oh, hello. I'm Jot.

15
00:01:46.141 --> 00:01:47.551
Hello, I'm Echo.

16
00:01:48.391 --> 00:01:49.260
Nice to meet you, Echo.

17
00:01:50.101 --> 00:01:53.880
Nice to meet you, too. Is this your balloon?

18
00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:58.351
No, I found it, but it keeps flying away.

19
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.860
Oh, no, not again.

20
00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:02.820
Let's follow it.

21
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.250
Let's wave hello to Echo.

22
00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.180
Hello, everyone.

23
00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:22.590
Whoa, what's this? A balloon on my head? Do I look good?

24
00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.540
Very good.

25
00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:26.700
Very funny.

26
00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.080
Thank you.

27
00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:30.360
Hello, I'm Jot.

28
00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:31.800
And I'm Echo.

29
00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:34.200
Hello, I'm Boom.

30
00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.360
Nice to meet you.

31
00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:38.010
Nice to meet you.

32
00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:42.150
Nice to meet you, too. Are you chasing that balloon?

33
00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:43.410
Yes.

34
00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:46.770
That looks fun. Let's go.

35
00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:48.990
Where is it?

36
00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.921
Balloon, where are you?

37
00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:55.410
Shh, listen.

38
00:02:55.980 --> 00:03:00.300
Everyone, be very quiet. Put your hand by your ear.

39
00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:03.990
Listen.

40
00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.574
I hear something.

41
00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.240
I hear it, too.

42
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:16.710
Where is it?

43
00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.541
Is it on the ground?

44
00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:20.520
No.

45
00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.250
Is it in the bushes?

46
00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:25.320
No.

47
00:03:26.281 --> 00:03:26.970
Look up.

48
00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.150
There it is.

49
00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.380
Hello, are you looking for that balloon?

50
00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.270
Yes, I'm Jot.

51
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:37.380
I'm Echo.

52
00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.060
And I'm Boom.

53
00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:40.859
Hello, I'm Tail.

54
00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.660
Nice to meet you, Tail.

55
00:03:42.914 --> 00:03:42.914
Nice to meet you, Tail.

56
00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.951
Nice to meet you, too.

57
00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.300
Don't worry, I can get the balloon. Almost.

58
00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:50.460
Almost.

59
00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.640
Aw, it's too high.

60
00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.980
Can you help Boom?

61
00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.910
Stay in your place and reach up high.

62
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.050
A little higher.

63
00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.430
It's still too high.

64
00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.531
Maybe we need a new idea.

65
00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.015
Maybe we need to work together.

66
00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.690
I have an idea. We can climb up.

67
00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.270
On each other's shoulders?

68
00:04:19.201 --> 00:04:19.650
Yes.

69
00:04:20.341 --> 00:04:21.900
Let's be very careful.

70
00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:23.820
And we can work together.

71
00:04:25.201 --> 00:04:26.190
Up you go, Jot.

72
00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:28.770
Up you go, Echo.

73
00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.710
Up you go, Tail.

74
00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.201
Almost.

75
00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:36.119
Hold still.

76
00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:38.610
I can almost reach it.

77
00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:40.591
You can do it, Tail.

78
00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.531
Everyone say, "You can do it."

79
00:04:54.031 --> 00:04:54.900
Almost.

80
00:04:58.951 --> 00:04:59.550
I got it.

81
00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.620
We did it.

82
00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.570
We worked together.

83
00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.430
And we got the balloon.

84
00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.289
Thank you, everyone.

85
00:05:07.951 --> 00:05:09.600
Let's celebrate with our friends.

86
00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.660
Put your hands up and say, "Hooray."

87
00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.000
Hooray.

88
00:05:25.365 --> 00:05:25.365
Hooray.

89
00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:25.395
Hooray.

90
00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.760
Wait, look at this.

91
00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.130
It's a card.

92
00:05:29.701 --> 00:05:30.570
What does it say?

93
00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:34.485
It says, "Hello, new friends."

94
00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:36.855
New friends?

95
00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:38.070
That's us.

96
00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.260
The balloon brought us together.

97
00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:51.960
Hello, Echo.

98
00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.540
Hello, Boom. Hello, Tail.

99
00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:55.800
Hello, Jot.

100
00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.870
Hello, new friends.

101
00:05:57.885 --> 00:05:57.885
Hello, new friends.

102
00:05:57.885 --> 00:05:57.914
Hello, new friends.

103
00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:02.835
Jot, Echo, Boom, and Tail met for the first time. Now they are friends.

104
00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.220
It's getting late.

105
00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.591
It's time to go home.

106
00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:12.570
Will we play again?

107
00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.270
Of course. See you, Echo.

108
00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:16.710
See you, Jot.

109
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:17.970
See you, Tail.

110
00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.170
See you, Boom.

111
00:06:20.281 --> 00:06:23.910
It's time to say goodbye. Wave to your new friends.

112
00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:35.010
See you.

113
00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:36.135
See you.

114
00:06:36.135 --> 00:06:36.135
See you.

115
00:06:36.135 --> 00:06:36.135
See you.

116
00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.140
Can you say it too?

117
00:06:49.065 --> 00:06:50.581
What a wonderful day.

118
00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:52.350
But wait,

119
00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:59.190
the balloon is flying away again. Where is it going now?

120
00:07:00.151 --> 00:07:03.390
Maybe another friend is waiting to say, "Hello."

121
00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.240
Who is this?

122
00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.570
It's Echo.

123
00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.850
Who is this?

124
00:07:25.651 --> 00:07:26.581
It's Tail.

125
00:07:28.561 --> 00:07:29.701
Who is this?

126
00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:37.831
It's Boom.

127
00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.100
Who is this?

128
00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.370
It's Jot.

129
00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:53.610
What is this?

130
00:08:01.905 --> 00:08:03.000
It's the balloon.

131
00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.000
Great job, boys and girls. Bye bye.
